sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant BS as Booking Service
    participant R as Redis
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant K as Kafka
    participant P as Payment Service
    participant CS as Cancel Service

    U->>BS: POST /book {hotelId, roomId, checkIn, checkOut, userId}
    BS->>R: Lua script: SET NX lock:room:r1:Jun5 .. Jun9 EX 600
    alt any lock fails
        R-->>BS: nil
        BS-->>U: 409 Room Unavailable
    else all locks acquired
        R-->>BS: OK (5 locks set)
        BS->>DB: INSERT booking {status: PENDING, idempotency_key}
        DB-->>BS: bookingId
        BS->>K: publish {bookingId, amount, userId}
        K->>P: process payment
        alt payment success
            P-->>BS: success
            BS->>DB: UPDATE availability → BOOKED (Jun5-Jun9)
            BS->>DB: UPDATE booking → CONFIRMED
            BS->>R: DEL 5 night locks
            BS->>R: DECRBY avail:hotel:h456 5
            BS->>R: if counter=0 → ZREM hotel from geo index
            BS-->>U: 200 bookingId
        else payment failure
            P-->>CS: failure
            CS->>DB: UPDATE booking → FAILED
            CS->>R: DEL 5 night locks
            CS-->>U: 402 Payment Failed
        end
    end
